WEBVTT

00:09:29.621 --> 00:09:32.996
the built space around us could
really threaten us.

00:09:33.204 --> 00:09:36.412
And while hospitals are designed,

00:09:36.412 --> 00:09:40.787
or at least we hope they are designed to
think about mitigation of disease,

00:09:41.537 --> 00:09:44.162
the apartment building that you live
in is not designed that way.

00:09:44.162 --> 00:09:48.787
The restaurant that you go to is not
designed to manage disease transfer.

00:09:48.829 --> 00:09:53.037
And so we are suddenly in this moment
where we have to think about all

00:09:53.037 --> 00:09:56.246
buildings as threatening our
health and all built spaces

00:09:56.579 --> 00:10:01.579
as potentially improving or protecting
us a little bit more seriously.